{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30241","headline":"座中走笔送前萧使君 · 薛逢","name":"座中走笔送前萧使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌惨惨咽离筵，槐柳阴阴五月天。\n未学苏秦荣佩印，却思平子赋归田。\n芙蓉欲绽溪边蘂，杨柳初迷渡口烟。\n自笑无成今老大，送君垂泪郭门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}